-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  mod_import_err_case_twin.pcpp - Module: two modules whose names differ only in case

  Break step of mod_import: std's Math and the fixture unit math are two
  names (PaskalCPP is case-sensitive), but one program cannot hold both:
  their generated files would be one file on a case-blind file system. The
  second registered (math, imported after Math) is rejected at its own
  header, fixtures\math.pcpp, whose marker says so. Nothing is emitted.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe mod_import_err_case_twin;

/*
  @@test
    kind error
  @@end
*/

@addmodulepath "$P:res/tests/mod/fixtures";
import Math, math;

begin
end.
